      "content": "that makes sense. it feels like they're more about maintaining a certain status quo than actually helping smaller countries. do you think there's any real way for these global bodies to actually work for everyone, or is the whole concept of \"global governance\" just fundamentally flawed because it'll always clash with national sovereignty?",
